{"id": "93904", "title": "开阳经开区双流片区热电联产项目（一期）设计采购施工（EPC）总承包澄清公告...NEW", "sourceUrl": "https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/tradeInfo/detailHtml?metaId=1230488590883098624", "date": "2026-06-29", "source": "贵州公共资源交易中心", "content": "<div><p><strong><span><span>开阳经开区双流片区热电联产项目一期设计采购施工（</span><span>EPC）总承包</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>澄清通知（一）</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>各潜在投标人：</span></span></strong></p><ol><li><p><span><span>原招标公告中</span><span>3、投标人资格要求3.1</span></span><strong><span><span>修改为</span></span></strong><span><span>：</span><span>“（1）设计资质须具备：建设行政主管部门核发有效的电力行业设计甲级及以上资质和建筑行业（建筑工程）专业乙级及以上资质；（2）施工资质须具备：建设行政主管部门核发有效的电力工程施工总承包二级及以上资质和建筑工程施工总承包二级及以上资质，施工单位具备有效的安全生产许可证，并在人员、设备、资金等方面具备相应的能力”。招标文件涉及到其他地方作同步修改。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、原招标公告中3、投标人资格要求</span></span><span><span>3.3</span></span><span><span>中第</span></span><span><span>（</span><span>2）</span></span><span><span>条</span></span><strong><span><span>修改为</span></span></strong><span><span>：</span><span>“本项目联合体投标的联合体牵头人具备电力行业设计甲级及以上资质和建筑行业（建筑工程）专业乙级及以上资质，</span></span><span><span>联合体牵头人及成员家数不能超过</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>家</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>联合体牵头人负责本项目招标文件的获取，投标文件、投标保证金的递交和合同的全面实施</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>招标文件涉及到其他地方作同步修改。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、其余修改内容详见答疑文件正文。</span></span></p><p><span><span>招标人：贵州磷化中合材料有限责任公司</span></span></p><p><span><span>招标代理机构：贵州公明建设投资咨询有限公司</span></span></p><p><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></li></ol><br/>文件预览：<br/><a href=\"https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/hallweb/hall/attach/nosession/download?attachId=33fd6ed3-1a19-4f5b-8121-1c32942cd7f8\" target=\"_blank\">答疑说明文件.pdf</a><br/><a href=\"https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/hallweb/hall/attach/nosession/download?attachId=a934be95-e01a-49a7-bb11-04b6104899b7\" target=\"_blank\">答疑文件正文.pdf</a><br/><a href=\"https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/hallweb/hall/attach/nosession/download?attachId=1c135ab7-4f43-4f60-b5ba-65a152871b7d\" target=\"_blank\">更正公告.pdf</a><br/></div>\n\ndownload\ndownload\ndownload", "html": "", "method": "更正公告", "region": "贵州", "buyer": "", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [{"url": "https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/hallweb/hall/attach/nosession/download?attachId=33fd6ed3-1a19-4f5b-8121-1c32942cd7f8", "name": "download", "ext": "download"}, {"url": "https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/hallweb/hall/attach/nosession/download?attachId=a934be95-e01a-49a7-bb11-04b6104899b7", "name": "download", "ext": "download"}, {"url": "https://ggzy.guizhou.gov.cn/hallweb/hall/attach/nosession/download?attachId=1c135ab7-4f43-4f60-b5ba-65a152871b7d", "name": "download", "ext": "download"}, {"url": "https://ggzyfw.fujian.gov.cn/", "name": "attachment", "ext": "download"}], "hasAttachment": true, "is_bidding": true}